Package: qa403-audio-analyzer
Version: @VERSION@
Section: electronics
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, zlib1g, libusb-1.0-0, libportaudio2, libfontconfig1, libssl3 | libssl1.1
Maintainer: Joost Breed <joost.breed.quicknet@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/breedj/qa40x-audio-analyzer-cp
Description: Audio analyzer for the QuantAsylum QA403
 Drives a QuantAsylum QA403 over USB with its own DSP, live plotting in the
 browser and a local measurement database. Self-contained .NET build: no
 runtime to install. After installing, add yourself to the plugdev group
 (sudo usermod -aG plugdev $USER) and log in again to open the device as a
 non-root user; the udev rule this package installs grants that group access.
